simhost contains code derived from serve-sim (https://github.com/EvanBacon/serve-sim),
Copyright Evan Bacon, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- Sources/SimHostKit/GuestSource.swift: the hinge, orientation and button services follow
  serve-sim's Duo HID helper (Sources/SimDuoHID/main.m).
- Sources/SimHostKit/Screens.swift and Sources/CSimHost/HIDClient.m: the framebuffer callbacks,
  the seed recheck and the Indigo message calls follow serve-sim's FrameCapture.swift and
  HIDInjector.swift.
- Sources/SimHostKit/Rotation.swift: the orientation event to the PurpleWorkspacePort follows
  serve-sim's HIDInjector.swift, which follows idb's FBSimulatorPurpleHID.

The changes: the keyboard service, the host and its protocol, and the rewrite in Swift and
Objective-C around them.
